2 (grid power, net steam). Upstream feedstock emissions are not included. Net steam export is credited as avoided gas fired boiler steam, so a large steam exporter can show a total below zero.","grid_kg_kwh":0.367},"greener":{"title":"Already the greener route; the carbon sits in the electricity","text":"Each tonne needs about 9.5 MWh for electrolysis. On a 2026 grid that is several tonnes of CO2, far worse than gas based methanol, so the plant only makes sense on dedicated renewable or nuclear power with biogenic or direct air CO2. Heat integration of electrolyser waste heat into the column reboiler would cut the remaining steam demand."},"hazards":[{"id":"CO","name":"Carbon monoxide","formula":"CO","cas":"630-08-0","ghs":[{"code":"H220","text":"Extremely flammable gas"},{"code":"H280","text":"Contains gas under pressure; may explode if heated"},{"code":"H331","text":"Toxic if inhaled"},{"code":"H360D","text":"May damage the unborn child"},{"code":"H372","text":"Causes damage to organs through prolonged or repeated exposure"}],"severe":true,"flash_point_C":null,"autoignition_C":607,"LFL_pct":10.9,"UFL_pct":74.0,"Tb_C":-192},{"id":"MeOH","name":"Methanol","formula":"CH3OH","cas":"67-56-1","ghs":[{"code":"H225","text":"Highly flammable liquid and vapour"},{"code":"H301","text":"Toxic if swallowed"},{"code":"H311","text":"Toxic in contact with skin"},{"code":"H331","text":"Toxic if inhaled"},{"code":"H370","text":"Causes damage to organs"}],"severe":true,"flash_point_C":9,"autoignition_C":440,"LFL_pct":6.0,"UFL_pct":36.0,"Tb_C":64},{"id":"H2","name":"Hydrogen","formula":"H2","cas":"1333-74-0","ghs":[{"code":"H220","text":"Extremely flammable gas"},{"code":"H280","text":"Contains gas under pressure; may explode if heated"}],"severe":true,"flash_point_C":null,"autoignition_C":560,"LFL_pct":4.0,"UFL_pct":77.0,"Tb_C":-253},{"id":"CO2","name":"Carbon dioxide","formula":"CO2","cas":"124-38-9","ghs":[{"code":"H280","text":"Contains gas under pressure; may explode if heated"},{"code":"ASPH","text":"Simple asphyxiant in confined spaces"}],"severe":false,"flash_point_C":null,"autoignition_C":null,"LFL_pct":null,"UFL_pct":23.5,"Tb_C":-78},{"id":"H2O","name":"Water","formula":"H2O","cas":"7732-18-5","ghs":[],"severe":false,"flash_point_C":null,"autoignition_C":null,"LFL_pct":null,"UFL_pct":23.5,"Tb_C":100}],"hazop":[{"node":"Hydrogen compressor","deviation":"Loss of containment","cause":"Seal or flange leak","consequence":"Hydrogen jet fire or explosion; invisible flame","safeguard":"Gas detection with automatic isolation, ventilated enclosure, hazardous area rating"},{"node":"Methanol converter","deviation":"High temperature","cause":"Loss of boiler water circulation","consequence":"Catalyst sintering, by product formation, overpressure","safeguard":"Steam drum level control, high temperature trip"},{"node":"CO2 supply","deviation":"Off spec CO2 (O2, sulphur)","cause":"Capture plant upset","consequence":"Catalyst poisoning; oxygen in a hydrogen rich loop","safeguard":"Online O2 and H2S analysers with feed trip, guard bed"},{"node":"Crude separator","deviation":"High level","cause":"Level control failure","consequence":"Liquid carry over into recycle circulator","safeguard":"High high level trip on circulator"},{"node":"Methanol storage","deviation":"Loss of containment","cause":"Overfill, tank failure","consequence":"Pool fire with an almost invisible flame; toxic exposure","safeguard":"Bund, foam system, nitrogen blanket, flame detectors"}],"process_hazards":[{"hazard":"High pressure","detail":"Up to 80 bar. Stored energy and loss of containment risk; relief, high integrity pressure protection, regular inspection of vessels and piping."},{"hazard":"Flammable materials","detail":"Carbon monoxide, Methanol, Hydrogen. Hazardous area classification, ignition source control, gas detection, fire protection."},{"hazard":"Toxic materials","detail":"Carbon monoxide, Methanol. Toxic gas detection, emergency shutdown and isolation, escape sets, minimise inventory."}],"validation":[{"metric":"Hydrogen per tonne of methanol","model":0.192589,"published":0.188,"unit":"t H2/t MeOH","error_pct":2.440727,"inside_range":null,"source":"IRENA and Methanol Institute, Innovation Outlook: Renewable Methanol (2021), section 2.3","url":"https://www.irena.org/-/media/Files/IRENA/Agency/Publication/2021/Jan/IRENA_Innovation_Renewable_Methanol_2021.pdf","note":"Stoichiometric figure. The model is above it by the hydrogen lost to the purge and to the reverse shift CO dissolved in the crude.","kind":"process","tolerance_pct":5,"pass":true},{"metric":"CO2 per tonne of methanol","model":1.401493,"published":1.373,"unit":"t CO2/t MeOH","error_pct":2.075253,"inside_range":null,"source":"IRENA and Methanol Institute, Innovation Outlook: Renewable Methanol (2021), section 2.3","url":"https://www.irena.org/-/media/Files/IRENA/Agency/Publication/2021/Jan/IRENA_Innovation_Renewable_Methanol_2021.pdf","note":"","kind":"process","tolerance_pct":5,"pass":true},{"metric":"Electricity including electrolysis","model":9.906975,"published":[10,11],"unit":"MWh/t MeOH","error_pct":-0.930248,"inside_range":false,"source":"IRENA and Methanol Institute, Innovation Outlook: Renewable Methanol (2021), section 2.3","url":"https://www.irena.org/-/media/Files/IRENA/Agency/Publication/2021/Jan/IRENA_Innovation_Renewable_Methanol_2021.pdf","note":"Electrolysis taken at 50 kWh/kg H2, the practical figure IRENA gives in the same chapter, so most of this check rests on that input; the plant's own compressors and pumps are computed.","kind":"energy","tolerance_pct":10,"pass":true},{"metric":"Fixed capital, CRI Norway e-methanol plant, scaled","model":24101474.612472,"published":263374485.596708,"unit":"USD","error_pct":-90.848971,"inside_range":null,"source":"IRENA and Methanol Institute, Innovation Outlook: Renewable Methanol (2021), Table 25 (CRI Norway: 300 t/d, 100 000 t/y, USD 200 million, Stefansson 2019); six tenths scaling and CEPCI 607.5 (2019) to 800.0 (2024)","url":"https://www.irena.org/-/media/Files/IRENA/Agency/Publication/2021/Jan/IRENA_Innovation_Renewable_Methanol_2021.pdf","note":"The published figure includes the electrolysers and CO2 supply, which this design buys over the fence, so the model is expected to sit well below it. Honest fail, not tuned.","kind":"capex","tolerance_pct":50,"pass":false},{"metric":"Production cost, e-methanol (CO2 from combined sources)","model":1376.433034,"published":[820,1620],"unit":"USD/t","error_pct":0.0,"inside_range":true,"source":"IRENA and Methanol Institute, Innovation Outlook: Renewable Methanol (2021), Table 15 (current cost, no carbon credit)","url":"https://www.irena.org/-/media/Files/IRENA/Agency/Publication/2021/Jan/IRENA_Innovation_Renewable_Methanol_2021.pdf","note":"IRENA range assumes green hydrogen at 4 000 to 8 000 USD/t; this run uses the regional green hydrogen price.","kind":"cost","tolerance_pct":25,"pass":true}],"assumptions":["Green hydrogen and dry CO2 are bought over the fence; electrolysers, power supply and capture are outside the battery limit and their capital is not in the plant cost.","Electrolysis electricity for the KPI is 50 kWh/kg H2 (IRENA 2021: 'closer to 50 MWh/t').","The converter reaches ideal gas chemical equilibrium with an approach of 10 K; CO2 hydrogenation and reverse shift are both active.","Crude condensation follows Raoult's law with Antoine vapour pressures; dissolved gases are let down and burnt with the purge in a package boiler.","0.5% of the methanol is lost to the column bottoms and vents.","All compressors are motor driven (no high pressure steam system on site).","Distillation reboiler duty is (R + 1) x distillate latent heat plus heating the water bottoms; 30 theoretical stages in one column."],"notes":[]}